{"title":"2023 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f994c86b99ee2211014c6e9534830f8c1cc95b4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.3 + 0.03$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc50d0c4983ff99af5470c97ff6e7840422e0603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 0.303 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 0.6 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 3.3 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 0.33 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 0.06$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"495\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/b/37b2924b8939abba0c96fb65174d579de3366095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.3 + 0.03 = 0.30 + 0.03 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 0.33}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"294\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2023 CEMC Fermat\">2023 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp